## 四、内存使用报告器

```
--------------------------------
ProfiledCPUMemoryReporter
来源: c10/core/CPUAllocator.h:24-36, CPUAllocator.cpp:203-290
--------------------------------

【状态】
    mutex_: std::mutex                                # 保护并发访问
    size_table_: unordered_map<void*, size_t>         # 指针 -> 分配大小
    allocated_: size_t = 0                            # 当前总分配量
    log_cnt_: size_t = 0                              # 日志计数器

【接口】
    New(ptr: void*, nbytes: size_t)
        用途: 记录新分配的内存
        调用: memoryProfilingEnabled(), reportMemoryUsageToProfiler()
        
        算法:
            if nbytes == 0: return
            
            profile_memory = memoryProfilingEnabled()
            
            if FLAGS_caffe2_report_cpu_memory_usage or profile_memory:
                lock(mutex_)
                size_table_[ptr] = nbytes
                allocated_ += nbytes
                allocated = allocated_
            
            if FLAGS_caffe2_report_cpu_memory_usage:
                LOG(INFO) << "C10 alloc " << nbytes << " bytes, total " << allocated
            
            if profile_memory:
                reportMemoryUsageToProfiler(ptr, nbytes, allocated, 0, Device(CPU))

    Delete(ptr: void*)
        用途: 记录释放的内存
        调用: memoryProfilingEnabled(), reportMemoryUsageToProfiler()
        
        算法:
            profile_memory = memoryProfilingEnabled()
            
            if FLAGS_caffe2_report_cpu_memory_usage or profile_memory:
                lock(mutex_)
                it = size_table_.find(ptr)
                if it != size_table_.end():
                    nbytes = it->second
                    allocated_ -= nbytes
                    allocated = allocated_
                    size_table_.erase(it)
                else:
                    # 每1000次警告一次
                    if log_cnt_++ % 1000 == 0:
                        LOG(WARNING) << "未知大小的内存块，可能在 profiling 启动前分配"
            
            if nbytes == 0: return
            
            if FLAGS_caffe2_report_cpu_memory_usage:
                LOG(INFO) << "C10 deleted " << nbytes << " bytes, total " << allocated
            
            if profile_memory:
                reportMemoryUsageToProfiler(ptr, -nbytes, allocated, 0, Device(CPU))

    OutOfMemory(nbytes: size_t)
        用途: 报告 OOM 事件
        调用: memoryProfilingEnabled(), reportOutOfMemoryToProfiler()
        
        算法:
            profile_memory = memoryProfilingEnabled()
            
            if FLAGS_caffe2_report_cpu_memory_usage or profile_memory:
                lock(mutex_)
                allocated = allocated_
            
            if nbytes == 0: return
            
            if FLAGS_caffe2_report_cpu_memory_usage:
                LOG(INFO) << "C10 OOM. Trying to allocate " << nbytes 
                          << " bytes, total " << allocated
            
            if profile_memory:
                reportOutOfMemoryToProfiler(nbytes, allocated, 0, Device(CPU))

【全局访问】
    profiledCPUMemoryReporter() -> ProfiledCPUMemoryReporter&
        用途: 获取全局单例
        实现: 静态局部变量，懒初始化
```

